          "evidence_kind": "lecture_paraphrase",
          "text": "The relaxation step for an edge (u, v) involves comparing the current distance to v with the candidate distance dist[u] + weight(u, v). If the candidate distance is smaller, update dist[v] to this candidate and set predecessor[v] to u.",
          "sources": [
            {
